{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/90643-merit-strong-blessings-peach","id":90643,"title":"Merit: Strong Blessings (***) (PEACH)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-13T21:36:07-07:00","id":90643,"title":"Merit: Strong Blessings (***) (PEACH)","content":"You are more than just an example of your Kith and kind: you're a living epitome of what your Kith represents. This Merit increases your Wyrd by one for the purposes of determining the numerical effects of Blessings such as the Gargantuan or Venombite kith blessing or the Elemental Seeming Blessing. For example, a Gargantuan of Wyrd 2 would increase by three size categories (and gain three health levels) rather than the standard two. The only limit on this Merit is that the maximum bonus remains that associated with Wyrd 10.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T21:59:05-07:00","id":90657,"title":"","content":"Just off the cuff, sounds overly expensive at 3 dots.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{